<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States signed a military cooperation agreement with Venezuela's interim government, prompting a U.S. marine to die after falling overboard during a Caribbean operation linked to the renewed ties. Former oil minister Machado called for a more drastic overhaul of the oil sector amid hyperinflation, food shortages, massive emigration and socioeconomic collapse. Venezuelan grassroots groups rejected the U.S. military agreement and denounced what they called a normalization of subordination. Two battle-related deaths occurred in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQaVlsN2FuNE82VGp2ZXBmTF9Odkk0OU5waE5qUGdMZnRRNjRtQlVWaTg4encxV1NiMU9FTWh4TnVLc09DN1dLOWlRRHczUDBsWjEzdk9vdzY2N0VldVlXdTBSQXBha3pfb3RrMDE4LUctbHE4eWxxbXRLVktPM28wZlZrNWpQcVM1WHF0bEl4MXdpdTZONVBsUzkwMGxmRHFPNTBiaFQ1UDNKSjVkd2JqVlRqclkzUWVPX09qUGxn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOM3VlUmtXdkJETU9WcE4tTVZzNGtzMFFxZ05LcG5IX1pwWkdhWjczSmlqUGt2UVpfUWx0SFhsVDJ4Q3pWX3k1Qjk5czZGRUlleEZEbTFkQ1p4QnpMLTc3YkpDVkotUThwbGo0Q3U3dmJlYVJISzBqNmd4Vlo3eWtCTGlZZHNKaWZSendTWkJVcWdSTzcxQjRpNHlVV2haUjA4cFg1U1E5Z2hDdEFnWWVWd1p3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE1POS1sRW9zNlBmRGxCUmhvVHd1THN3ajVXQ2N1VE9lLXp0WGV0dHB5UVZuOXZaRWdYcjkybUs4ejMyVG16RzhYUWt0N3JxS18xbmpXcWVqQ2FoOFJFWldaUkd3TTcxbUM5aWVLWg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Slant Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQTVpwOG9zZFFUazB3RTJEWFlvM1JRaC1jUUM2RmdKR1F6VW5zd25CSElVc2Q2RjdRQUdRRGcwNUltVXpkV0ZrOWFDMkRoUjRWMlJqbUtOcUFNY3ZjTGRWVnloUnpnMm54S3RkZ0hUVkMyVHV3a2hlbVhydXMxOXhoUHNB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Slant Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAF